el, who to challenge, and how to shape your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter shops</strong>, hospitals, spas, and fusion points along your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totems and random events</strong> offer powerful buffs, risky debuffs, and one-of-a-kind rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hybrid battle system</strong> that combines real-time action with turn-based tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate challenge in the <strong>Stadium Showdown</strong>, where only the strongest trainers survive. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Crazy Goat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/bbda84eea80d3a75f58366777b9c73cdba5c7c50/header.jpg?t=1769176568","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"@2025 Maciej Stru\u017cyna (Crazy Goat Games). All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939760/918948720/26a28b273f9049cb33bb71469cddc2cd2d15822a/1756215247/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761740883","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939760/918948720/26a28b273f9049cb33bb71469cddc2cd2d15822a/1756215247/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761740883","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3939760/918948720/26a28b273f9049cb33bb71469cddc2cd2d15822a/1756215247/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761740883","id":257189161,"name":"Path to Tamer Town - Annoucement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189161/893e4454f932e8aff0b5aa1ec71582f2bbf0e78d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761740883"}],"name":"Path to Tamer Town","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b